d in the early 1620s, and is currently housed at the Art Gallery of South Australia in Adelaide.","View of Bracciano"],"29656887":["Stag Hunt is an oil on canvas painting by Flemish painter Paul Bril. Probably painted in the 1590s, it is part of the collection of the Louvre in Paris.","Stag Hunt"],"64513344":["Self-Portrait is an oil on canvas painting by Flemish painter Paul Bril. It was probably painted between 1595 and 1600, and is in the collection of the Rhode Island School of Design Museum in Providence, Rhode Island.","Self-Portrait (Bril)"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}